in Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Various choices and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Shakespeare's work states, &quot;Life is a series of choices,&quot; you will be forced to make choices that seem like everyday choices. A single response can change the future...<br>Not only that, but a variety of choices will unfold that can lead to humor, seriousness, horror, suspense, and mysterious endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆A thorough commitment to realism</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scenario that seems like it could happen on the edge of reality, where everyone has thought, &quot;I want to go back to those days...&quot; and fantasies. Communication through chat and short videos. We've stuck to realism to create a sense of immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see the ending with the heroine, you will surely think: <br>&quot;Love starts again.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
